The chinese tea culture is historical. Chinese like drinking tea, and tea is not only a healthy drinks, but also a integral part of traditional culture. Diffrent side produce 
varieties of tea, such as green tea, rea tea and WuLong tea. People always drink tea and chat easily with friends and families. Nowadays, the  culture of tea has passed through 
